{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"Part of #148.\n\n- Query `ProjectV2.views` via `gh api graphql`: `name number layout filter groupByFields verticalGroupByFields sortByFields fields` (visible fields in order).\n- `v` / `V` cycle the views of the current project; the header shows `Board: <project> · <view> (i/n)`.\n- No views / fetch failure → fall back to the current fixed `Status` kanban.\n- Views live in the same disk cache entry as the board and follow its stale re-fetch (`r` refreshes them too).\n- The `project` scope is already required for `gh project`; no new scope.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-09-01T03:05:56Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":149,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Projects: fetch saved views and switch between them"}
